<title>JAPAN: Fuji TV sets minimum price for stock auction.</title>
<headline>Fuji TV sets minimum price for stock auction.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nationwide Japanese broadcaster Fuji Television Network Inc said on Friday that it set the minimum price for a forthcoming stock auction at 450,000 yen per share.</p>
<p>The auction of 116,000 shares is scheduled for July 29.</p>
<p>Fuji Television's shares will be listed on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) on August 8.</p>
</text>
